as much as the DevTeam members are. Of course, the difference is that
being in the DevTeam denotes a certain level of programming competency,
familiarity with the source, and awareness of NetHack's gameplay and
aesthetics that isn't guaranteed from some hack like me who doesn't
even know the difference between "int" and "register int".

